  "releaseNotes": "Adds verified local dependency source folders to context search, object, usages, and prepare.\n      Restored symbols remain authoritative while exact-matching source adds implementation evidence with explicit provenance and diagnostics.\n      CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
